  _headline: Reserva da rede estava parada desde o ano passado
  _headlineEn: Grid backup had been down since last year
  _body: "A pe\xE7a de reposi\xE7\xE3o tinha prazo de entrega. O prazo era \"em breve\"
    e j\xE1 fez anivers\xE1rio."
  _bodyEn: The spare part had a delivery date. The date was "soon" and it just had
    a birthday.
